      "name": "ScriptOp_LoopDecrementBranch",
      "start": "0x00FC6C",
      "end": "0x00FC94",
      "size_bytes": 40,
      "description": "Decrements loop counter indexed by +1(a0) at $FF1826. If result is non-zero, adds displacement +2(a0) to script PC a0 (looping). If counter reaches zero, advances past 4-byte instruction.",
